      "fine_trace_step": 6,
      "description": "The vulnerable corruption guard fails to reject the wrapped geometry because `size` has wrapped back to 12. It never checks that `desc_start` already lies past the buffer or that `size < desc_start`, which is exactly what the fix adds."
