      "fine_trace_step": 9,
      "description": "With `note_name == last`, `memcmp(note_name, \"GNU\\0\", 4)` reads 4 bytes starting at the end of the 12-byte heap testcase buffer and triggers the observed AddressSanitizer heap-buffer-overflow read."
